<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Cylinder Volume</title>
</head>
<body>

    <p id="result"></p>

    <script src="main.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
//JS
class Cylinder {
    constructor(radius, height) {
        this.radius = radius;
        this.height = height;
    }

    volume() {
        return Math.PI * this.radius ** 2 * this.height;
    }
}

let cylinder = new Cylinder(5, 10);

document.getElementById("result").innerHTML =
    cylinder.volume().toFixed(4);
//SELF
class Cylinder → Cylinder object uchun class yaratdik

constructor() → radius va heightni qabul qiladi

this.radius → radiusni object ichida saqlaydi

this.height → heightni object ichida saqlaydi

volume() → cylinder hajmini hisoblaydi

Math.PI → π qiymati

** 2 → radiusni kvadratga oshiradi

toFixed(4) → natijani 4 ta kasr xonasi bilan chiqaradi
class → objectlar uchun qolip

constructor() → object yaratilganda ishlaydi

this → shu objectni bildiradi

new → classdan yangi object yaratadi

volume() → hajmni hisoblaydi

Math.PI → π

** 2 → kvadrat

toFixed(4) → 4 ta kasr xonasi
